# Reading surface is locked

The current black-and-white three-box UI is the product. Do not restyle it.

- White field, black hairline boxes, no color, no nav, no extra chrome
- Landing is empty boxes; content appears only after click
- After all three are open: title, edition date, and “You're all caught up…”
- No feeds, archives, related stories, share strips, or buttons on the reading page

New work belongs behind this surface (dated editions, persistence, publish) or is out of scope.

```tsx
// BAD — preview on a closed box
<button>The Good</button>

// GOOD — empty box, label only for assistive tech
<button aria-label="Open The Good" />
```
